{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban the sale and import of any raw milk",
        "additional_details": "Raw milk has been proven responsible for the spread of diseases (such as intestinal diseases), and is especially dangerous to certain groups such as children, the elderly and immunocompromised people. By preventing the sale/import of unpasteurised milk, outbreaks of disease could be reduced or even avoided completely.",
        "background": "Ban the sale and import of unpasteurised milk in any form, from any seller, including licensed providers and tested products, to prevent the spread of pathogens through the consumption of raw milk.",
